---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Calvin Chun Wai Tai | Home" description="Career snapshot and portfolio intro">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 md:px-10 pt-20 md:pt-28 pb-16 md:pb-24">
    <p class="font-heading text-sm md:text-base tracking-widest mb-6">Personal Portfolio</p>

    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-start">
      <div class="flex-1">
        <h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl leading-[0.95]">Chun Wai Tai (Calvin)</h1>

        <div class="mt-5 h-2 w-28 md:w-40 bg-violent-red" aria-hidden="true"></div>

        <div class="mt-10 space-y-6 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed text-black/75">
          <p>
            Hi, I’m Calvin. I help brands scale across borders by mixing hard data with authentic storytelling.
          </p>
          <p>
            Over the last 15 years, I’ve driven growth and digital rollouts for organizations like OCBC Bank, MoneyGram, and UNICEF. Most recently, as VP of Brand & Communications at OCBC Bank, my focus was connecting Western and Asian digital ecosystems—balancing aggressive market expansion with the strict risk frameworks of the financial sector.
          </p>
          <p>
            I don't just stay at the strategy level; I'm an active builder. When I'm not tracking macro market shifts, I'm experimenting with AI dev tools like Google Gemini (nano banana, antigravity etc.) or working on my conversational Japanese and Mandarin. I'm always looking for the next technology and language skills to build stronger connections. Below are some of my recent certifictions:
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-12 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
          <a
            href="/projects"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center border-4 border-black px-7 py-3 font-heading text-lg hover:bg-black hover:text-white"
          >
            View Projects
          </a>
          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center border-4 border-violent-red px-7 py-3 font-heading text-lg hover:bg-violent-red hover:text-white"
          >
            Get In Touch
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <figure class="shrink-0 w-[300px] mx-auto md:mx-0 mt-10 md:mt-0">
        <img
          src="/images/calvin.jpg"
          alt="Portrait of Calvin Chun Wai Tai"
          width="300"
          height="225"
          class="w-full aspect-[4/3] object-cover border-4 border-black shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)]"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl border-t-4 border-black">
    <div class="py-16 md:py-24 px-6 md:px-10">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-12 md:mb-16">About Me / Career Snapshot</h2>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-x-8 lg:gap-x-16 gap-y-16">
        <!-- Grid Item 1 -->
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
          <div class="h-16 w-16 rounded-full bg-black text-white flex items-center justify-center border-4 border-black hover:bg-violent-red hover:border-violent-red hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300 mb-6 shrink-0">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M11.48 3.499c.195-.49.887-.49 1.082 0l2.001 5.034 5.402.434c.534.043.748.702.35 1.079l-4.043 3.824 1.157 5.25c.114.518-.444.924-.902.656l-4.717-2.75-4.717 2.75c-.458.268-1.016-.138-.902-.656l1.157-5.25L3.684 10.046c-.398-.377-.184-1.036.35-1.079l5.402-.434 2.001-5.034Z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-heading uppercase mb-3 tracking-tight">Brand Strategy</h3>
          <p class="text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed text-black/75 max-w-[280px]">
            Modernized corporate identities and led complex campaigns for major financial institutions & NGO.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Grid Item 2 -->
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
          <div class="h-16 w-16 rounded-full bg-black text-white flex items-center justify-center border-4 border-black hover:bg-violent-red hover:border-violent-red hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300 mb-6 shrink-0">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 18 9 11.25l4.306 4.306a11.95 11.95 0 0 1 5.814-5.518l2.74-1.22m0 0-5.94-2.281m5.94 2.28-2.28 5.941" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-heading uppercase mb-3 tracking-tight">Omnichannel Growth</h3>
          <p class="text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed text-black/75 max-w-[280px]">
            Engineered data-driven campaigns and engagement strategies to boost brand awareness and revenue.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Grid Item 3 -->
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
          <div class="h-16 w-16 rounded-full bg-black text-white flex items-center justify-center border-4 border-black hover:bg-violent-red hover:border-violent-red hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300 mb-6 shrink-0">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 6.75V15m6-6v8.25m.503 3.498 4.897-2.448a.75.75 0 0 0 .413-.67V5.25a.75.75 0 0 0-.413-.67l-4.897-2.448a.75.75 0 0 0-.684 0L9.493 4.58a.75.75 0 0 1-.684 0L3.913 2.132A.75.75 0 0 0 3.5 2.802v12.45a.75.75 0 0 0 .413.67l4.897 2.448a.75.75 0 0 0 .684 0l4.597-2.298a.75.75 0 0 1 .684 0Z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-heading uppercase mb-3 tracking-tight">East-West Digital Mastery</h3>
          <p class="text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed text-black/75 max-w-[280px]">
            Fluent in navigating both Western and Asian digital ecosystems. Orchestrated high-impact omnichannel web, mobile and social media rollouts.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Grid Item 4 -->
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
          <div class="h-16 w-16 rounded-full bg-black text-white flex items-center justify-center border-4 border-black hover:bg-violent-red hover:border-violent-red hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300 mb-6 shrink-0">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m3.75 13.5 10.5-11.25L12 10.5h8.25L9.75 21.75 12 13.5H3.75Z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-heading uppercase mb-3 tracking-tight">CORPORATE & ENTREPRENEURIAL AGILITY</h3>
          <p class="text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed text-black/75 max-w-[280px]">
            Founded and scaled a profitable creative agency, leveraging this entrepreneurial experience to drive rapid digital innovation for enterprises and clients.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Grid Item 5 -->
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
          <div class="h-16 w-16 rounded-full bg-black text-white flex items-center justify-center border-4 border-black hover:bg-violent-red hover:border-violent-red hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300 mb-6 shrink-0">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 3v1m0 16v1m9-9h-1M4 12H3m15.364-6.364l-.707.707M6.364 17.636l-.707.707m0-11.312l.707.707m11.312 11.312l.707-.707M12 8a4 4 0 100 8 4 4 0 000-8z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-heading uppercase mb-3 tracking-tight">TECH-FORWARD ADAPTABILITY</h3>
          <p class="text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed text-black/75 max-w-[280px]">
            Enhanced digital execution and workflow efficiency by continuously learning and adopting emerging AI technologies, establishing a comprehensive approach to marketing.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Grid Item 6 -->
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
          <div class="h-16 w-16 rounded-full bg-black text-white flex items-center justify-center border-4 border-black hover:bg-violent-red hover:border-violent-red hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300 mb-6 shrink-0">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 21a9.004 9.004 0 0 0 8.716-6.747M12 21a9.004 9.004 0 0 1-8.716-6.747M12 21c2.485 0 4.5-4.03 4.5-9S14.485 3 12 3m0 18c-2.485 0-4.5-4.03-4.5-9S9.515 3 12 3m0 0a8.997 8.997 0 0 1 7.843 4.582M12 3a8.997 8.997 0 0 0-7.843 4.582m15.686 0A11.953 11.953 0 0 1 12 10.5c-2.998 0-5.74-1.1-7.843-2.918m15.686 0A8.959 8.959 0 0 1 21 12c0 .778-.099 1.533-.284 2.253m0 0A17.919 17.919 0 0 1 12 16.5c-3.162 0-6.133-.815-8.716-2.247m0 0A9.015 9.015 0 0 1 3 12c0-.778.099-1.533.284-2.253" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-heading uppercase mb-3 tracking-tight">Global SIGHT & EXPERIENCE</h3>
          <p class="text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed text-black/75 max-w-[280px]">
            Managing cross-border marketing operations and stakeholder environments spanning more than 35 countries. Multicultural perspective.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
